{"body": "Rationale for this change\nSupport for Concurrent Append Operations\nRefresh Table\n\nIf changes in the table's metadata are detected (indicating that other transactions have been committed during this period), update the table's metadata and the current parent_snapshot_id.\n\nIf no changes are detected, proceed with the normal commit.\n\nAre these changes tested?\nUT\nAre there any user-facing changes?", "date": "2025-04-07T03:04:06Z", "hash": "sha256:686f071702499aa46295", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg-python#1885", "meta": {"additions": 62, "association": "NONE", "base": "main", "closed_at": "2026-03-25T00:30:11Z", "comments": 5, "deletions": 0, "draft": false, "files": ["pyiceberg/table/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/table/update/snapshot.py", "tests/integration/test_add_files.py"], "labels": ["stale"], "last_commit": "2025-04-07T02:59:35Z", "n_files": 3, "number": 1885, "repo": "apache/iceberg-python", "state": "closed", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2026-03-25T00:30:11Z"}, "people": ["YinZheng-Sun"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "feat: refresh table when committing to support concurrent appends", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg-python/pull/1885"}
